    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42168</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_117_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>か、勝てね～……んだよ、アイツ……
インチキだろ、あの強さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't beat him...What's with this guy?
They've gotta be cheating!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_117_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん……すごーく強いね……
全然、勝てないし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, way too strong. I can't even touch
them!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_117_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んにゃろ～今度こそ！
こてんぱんにのしてやっからな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ngh! I'll beat you to a pulp this time,
just you wait!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42512</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_117_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そのためにはグミやボトルをしっかりそろえて、
なりきる職業もしっかり選んでおかなきゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Make sure we've got the right items on
hand. And run the right jobs, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42596</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_117_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だな！　おーしっ！　待ってろよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right! Okay, you stay right there!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
